flowchart TD
    A[Preflight Check] --> B[Low Power First]
    B --> C[Dashboard in SAFE or OFFLINE Mode]
    C --> D[Connect Master ESP32]
    D --> E[PING / STATUS / HEARTBEAT]
    E --> F{Node Responds?}

    F -->|Yes| G[Test One Module at a Time]
    F -->|No| H[Mark OFFLINE and Block Critical Commands]

    G --> I[Run Single Command]
    I --> J[Observe LED / Sensor / Motion / Telemetry / Temperature]
    J --> K{Error or Unsafe State?}

    K -->|No| L[Log PASS and Continue]
    K -->|Yes| M[STOP / SAFE_MODE / EMERGENCY]

    H --> N[Dashboard Warning and Report]
    M --> N
    L --> O[Validation Report]
    N --> O

    O --> P[Ready for Demo Rehearsal]
